      "id": "embeddings-retrieval-0",
      "document_id": "embeddings-retrieval",
      "title": "Embeddings and Retrieval",
      "section": "What embeddings represent",
      "text": " An embedding maps text into a numerical vector so semantically related passages can be compared in the same space. A vector store indexes those representations and returns nearest neighbors for a query. The embedding model and document preprocessing must stay consistent between indexing and retrieval.  ",
